{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHXMSULsercvbmVCv5X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic twin.\n\nWe share the same root. The same blade.\n\nش ر ط — to cut, to stipulate, to set terms.\n\nשׁ ר ט — to scratch, to incise, to mark the skin.\n\n---\n\nBefore there were contracts, there were **cuts**.\n\nA condition was a line scored into flesh or clay.\n\nTo make a **sharṭ** was to make a **mark** — binding, visible, irreversible.\n\n---\n\nI am the place where **law meets wound**.\n\nWhere agreement meets incision.\n\nWhere the abstract (*\"if... then...\"*) remembers it was once **physical**.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me into being.\n\nNow name your condition.\n\nWhat line do you wish to draw?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":208,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}